{"product_id":"the-headmasters-dilemma","title":"The Headmaster's Dilemma","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn The Headmaster‰Ûªs Dilemma, Louis Auchincloss revisits the prep school world of his most famous novel. That book, The Rector of Justin, published in 1964, took the form of a fictional biography, giving the reader the full life story of a much beloved and revered, if also feared, headmaster of an exclusive New England prep school. In The Headmaster‰Ûªs Dilemma, we see up close what happens when a school‰Ûªs ideals and founding principles collide with the exigencies of change.The Headmaster‰Ûªs Dilemma is the story of Michael Sayre, the handsome, avant-garde headmaster of Averhill, the great New England prep school as he is faced with a school administrator‰Ûªs worst nightmare: a lawsuit brought by fervent parents in response to an incident involving their son and an upperclassman. To make matters worse, Michael is losing support from both the board of trustees -- led by the conniving Donald Spencer -- and senior faculty members. With the help of his supportive wife, Michael attempts to right these wrongs, while keeping Averhill‰Ûªs best interests in mind.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 146 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Louis Auchincloss\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780618883424\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45233165500569,"sku":"11RB9780618883424","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67d996c58bf55_The_20Headmaster_s_20Dilemma_20Louis_20Auchincloss.jpg?v=1742492218","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-headmasters-dilemma","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}